// SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
// Windows resource script: the PE icon and the application manifest.
//
// Compiled by `build.rs` with `windres` on the GNU target. The icon is what
// Explorer, the Start Menu, the taskbar and the installer display; the
// manifest is what makes the process per-monitor-v2 DPI aware before the
// window exists (without it Windows picks the DPI behaviour and the shell
// either renders blurry or at the wrong scale on high-DPI displays).
//
// Regenerate the icon with `bun scripts/packaging/windows/generate-icon.ts`.

1 ICON "icon.ico"

1 24 "zetawork-gui.manifest"
